//! # Sigil Web
//!
//! A React-inspired web application framework built on Sigil's polysynthetic
//! programming paradigm. Sigil Web leverages Sigil's unique features to create
//! type-safe, high-performance web applications.
//!
//! ## Features
//!
//! - **Evidentiality-Driven State**: Track data provenance with `!` (known/computed),
//!   `?` (uncertain), `~` (reported/external), and `‽` (paradox) markers
//! - **Morpheme Operators**: Compose transformations with Greek-letter operators:
//!   - `τ` (tau): map/transform
//!   - `φ` (phi): filter
//!   - `σ` (sigma): sort
//!   - `ρ` (rho): reduce/fold
//!   - `α` (alpha): first element
//!   - `Ω` (omega): last element
//!   - `π` (pi): project/select
//! - **Parallel Morphemes**: Concurrent operations with `par·τ`, `par·φ`, `par·σ`, `par·ρ`
//! - **Async Patterns**: Modern async with `⌛` (await), `await·all`, `await·race`
//! - **Actor-Based State**: Message passing with `tell` (fire-and-forget), `ask` (request-response)
//! - **Streams**: Reactive streams with `τ·flow`, `φ·flow` flow morphemes
//! - **Channels**: Message passing with `voice` (send), `listen` (receive)
//! - **Quantifiers**: Logical predicates with `∀` (for all), `∃` (exists)
//! - **Zero-Cost Abstractions**: Compile-time optimization for production builds
//!
//! ## Quick Start
//!
//! ```sigil
//! use sigil_web::prelude::*
//!
//! component Counter {
//!     state count: i64! = 0
//!
//!     fn render(self) -> Element {
//!         div {
//!             h1 { "Count: {self.count}" }
//!             button[onclick: || self.count += 1] { "+" }
//!             button[onclick: || self.count -= 1] { "-" }
//!         }
//!     }
//! }
//!
//! fn main() {
//!     App::mount("#root", Counter::new())
//! }
//! ```
//!
//! ## Morpheme Pipeline Example
//!
//! ```sigil
//! // Using morpheme operators for data transformation
//! let results! = users
//!     |φ{u => u.active}           // filter active users
//!     |τ{u => u.score * 2}        // map: double scores
//!     |σ                          // sort ascending
//!     |ρ+                         // reduce: sum all
//!
//! // Parallel processing for large datasets
//! let processed! = large_dataset|par·τ{expensive_compute}|collect()
//! ```
//!
//! ## Async Data Fetching
//!
//! ```sigil
//! // Using ⌛ for async/await
//! let data~ = fetch("/api/users")⌛
//!
//! // Parallel fetches with await·all
//! let (users~, posts~) = (fetch_users(), fetch_posts())·await·all
//!
//! // Race for fastest response
//! let fastest~ = mirrors|τ{fetch}·await·race
//! ```

